                "Fire (op): The target and any other characters at range 0-2 must make a TN 3 ^\"Meditation\" check (Air 4, Water 1) or suffer ^\"Dazed\" and strife equal to three times your Fire Ring."
                "Fire +(op): Increase severity of any critical strikes inflicted as part of this action by 2 per (op) spent this way."
            }
        }

