                "Fire (op): When the fire kami's fatigue exceeds its endurance, it detonates. Each character at range 0-3 must resist with a TN 5 ^\"Fitness\" check (Air 6, Water 3) or suffer supernatural damage equal to two times your Fire Ring and ^\"Burning\" and ^\"Dazed\"."
