            EFFECTS "If you succeed, you summon and ready a ^\"Bō\" made of water. It has the ^\"Snaring\" quality. At the end of each round, you may transform this weapon into a different melee weapon. Persists until end of any turn in which it leaves your grip or until end of scene."
            OPPORTUNITIES {
                "Water (op): The weapon can be any kind of melee or ranged weapon instead."
                "Water (op): You may immediately perform a Strike action using the weapon."
                "Water (op): When performing an Attack action with this weapon, treat its minimum or maximum range as 1 higher or lower."
            }
        }

